WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Open Theme from the sidebar.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.200
Click a preset to apply it instantly.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.200
Return to the default cryozen preset.

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.700
Open Customize to change colors, font, density, and background.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.300
Set Background / Effect, here Perlin Flow.

6
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.000
Name the theme and click Save.

7
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.300
Drag Intensity up. Changes save to the theme as you make them.

8
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.900
Close the window: the effect runs behind every conversation.
